{"lines": ["A single subatomic particle hit Earth with the energy of a thrown baseball, and nothing in space can explain it.", "Utah, October nineteen ninety-one. A detector called Fly's Eye was watching the night sky for flashes.", "It caught one streak with forty million times the energy of our best particle accelerators.", "And it gets stranger. Scientists traced it backwards, and nothing out there was powerful enough to have made it.", "Nothing in our galaxy had the power. They named it the Oh-My-God particle.", "Maybe it came from another galaxy. But it carried more energy than any ray from that far away should have.", "Then in twenty twenty-one, a second one arrived, from an empty patch of space called the Local Void.", "Some physicists now wonder if it needs physics we don't know yet.", "What threw it at us: a monster in another galaxy, or something new in physics?"], "words": [["A", 0.0, 0.06], ["single", 0.06, 0.34], ["subatomic", 0.34, 0.92], ["particle", 0.92, 1.42], ["hit", 1.42, 1.9], ["Earth", 1.9, 2.22], ["with", 2.22, 2.58], ["the", 2.58, 2.7], ["energy", 2.7, 3.06], ["of", 3.06, 3.3], ["a", 3.3, 3.4], ["thrown", 3.4, 3.66], ["baseball,", 3.66, 4.1], ["and", 4.78, 5.02], ["nothing", 5.02, 5.32], ["in", 5.32, 5.52], ["space", 5.52, 5.78], ["can", 5.78, 6.16], ["explain", 6.16, 6.54], ["it.", 6.54, 6.82], ["Utah,", 7.308, 7.54], ["October", 7.88, 8.14], ["nineteen", 8.14, 8.422], ["ninety-one.", 8.422, 8.74], ["A", 9.9, 10.04], ["detector", 10.04, 10.32], ["called", 10.32, 10.88], ["Fly's", 10.88, 11.46], ["Eye", 11.46, 11.68], ["was", 11.68, 12.12], ["watching", 12.12, 12.5], ["the", 12.5, 12.7], ["night", 12.7, 12.86], ["sky", 12.86, 13.22], ["for", 13.22, 13.54], ["flashes.", 13.54, 13.82], ["It", 14.471, 14.52], ["caught", 14.52, 14.7], ["one", 14.7, 14.98], ["streak", 14.98, 15.34], ["with", 15.72, 15.9], ["forty", 15.9, 16.2], ["million", 16.2, 16.46], ["times", 16.46, 16.98], ["the", 16.98, 17.52], ["energy", 17.52, 17.84], ["of", 17.84, 18.22],